            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "pldmtool/pldm_cmd_helper.hpp",
                    "line": 93,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "Why `l`? That seems a bit absurd? How about `N`?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "pldmtool/pldm_cmd_helper.hpp",
                    "line": 93,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vishnunithyasoundhar S",
                        "email": "vishnunithyasoundhar.s@intel.com",
                        "username": "VishnuNithyaSoundharS"
                    },
                    "message": "I didn't want people to confuse it with -n (retry count).\n\nIf you feel that wouldn't be a problem then I can switch it back to -N, which honestly feels better than l.\n\nOnce you confirm I can switch it to -N instead of -l"
                },
                {
                    "file": "pldmtool/pldm_cmd_helper.hpp",
                    "line": 93,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "I don't think `N` vs `n` is particularly tricky. In my opinion `l` is confusing because it is not at all related to the intent.\n\nHowever, I'm not a maintainer of openbmc/pldm, ultimately they should choose."
                },
                {
                    "file": "pldmtool/pldm_cmd_helper.hpp",
                    "line": 93,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vishnunithyasoundhar S",
                        "email": "vishnunithyasoundhar.s@intel.com",
                        "username": "VishnuNithyaSoundharS"
                    },
                    "message": "Understood. I\u2019ll switch it to -N for now and wait for input from the maintainers if they have suggestions."
                },
                {
                    "file": "pldmtool/pldm_cmd_helper.hpp",
                    "line": 93,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vishnunithyasoundhar S",
